    {
      "text": "### readmode   --> default is permissive\n\n1. permissive:  *Sets all fields to null when it encounters a corrupted record and places all corrupted records in a string column called _corrupt_record*\n2. dropMalformed: drop the row that contains malformed records, like schema is not working, or row is malformed\n3. failFast: Faile immediately upon encoutering malformed records",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "1f9f29accc75494abfbc9"
    },
    {
      "text": "%spark\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions.{col, expr, sum, current_date,lit}",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/scala",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "scala",
