    {
      "text": "\n#### Sorting Rows\n\n1. **SortBy**\n2. **OrderBy**\n\nNote: For optimization purposes, it’s sometimes advisable to sort within each partition before another\nset of transformations. You can use the sortWithinPartitions method to do this or  while loading you can use  spark.read.parquet(somefile).sortWithinPartitions(\"country\")",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
