      "text": "%spark\nAssignment 1:\n\n1. val flightDF1 = read flightdf Data as Dataframe\n2. val flightDF2 = write it back to hdfs and read the same to compare\n3. write test case  where flightDF1 count should be === flightDF2\n4. create flight Schema and read flight DF with Schema\n",
